# FINAL DESIGN REQUIREMENT

This update should make the game feel like a much larger and more intense military operation.

The player should no longer fight alone. Three additional AI squadmates should provide meaningful combat support, protect one another, and communicate naturally.

The battlefield should become much more alive through at least 120 additional radio messages, including urgent orders, combat reports, distress transmissions, screaming, and final communications from destroyed units.

Every victory should feel rewarding through a cinematic after-action presentation that highlights the MVP, Best Teammate, and other outstanding performances.

Every boss should be extremely fast, aggressive, and dangerous while remaining fair enough to fight.

Finally, the REVENANT should make defeat have consequences. When the player fails a game mode, their previously selected mech should return in the next attempt as a powerful corrupted enemy, with white armor, purple energy, a bright purple outline, unique abilities, and disturbing radio transmissions.

**The overall experience should feel like a military mech squad fighting increasingly dangerous enemies, where victories are celebrated, squad losses are felt, and every failure can bring back a corrupted version of the player's own machine.**